stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AwaitingDescription : CREATE_ENTITY (msg_id 0x09) received\nentity registered; enterCount at entity+0x10 initialized to N\n(N = number of expected createOnClient cascade steps)

    AwaitingDescription --> EnteringAoI : EntityManager_EnterAoI fires\n@ ghidra://SGW.exe@0x00dd2800\nassert getEnterCount() > 0\ndecrement entity+0x10

    EnteringAoI --> EnteringAoI : next enterAoI message\ndecrement entity+0x10\nif still > 0: stay here

    EnteringAoI --> EnteredWorld : enterCount reaches 0\nEntityManager_EnterWorld @ 0x00dd1d00 fires\nGameEntityManager_FlushDeferredNotifications drains queue

    AwaitingDescription --> RemoteManaged : entity+0x18 bit 0 = CEF_Remote set\n*(uint*)(entity+0x18) &= 0x7ffffffd\ndeferred-enter cascade skipped

    EnteredWorld --> [*] : entity visible to client\nclient instance live in world

    RemoteManaged --> [*] : remote-managed entity\nno local AoI countdown

    note right of EnteringAoI
        Three lookup paths in EnterAoI decompile:
        * primary map (this+0x18) — assert > 0, decrement
        * secondary map (this+0x24) — decrement piVar6[4]+0x10;
          if 0 and not CEF_Remote: FUN_00c6a1e0 + CancelDeferredNotifications
        * neither — LookupOrEmplaceDeferredEntitySlot(this+0x30, entityId)

        Source-doc override: the old RE doc said
        "increments reference count" — that is WRONG.
        The code DECREMENTS entity+0x10.
    end note

